            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37933096?u=b11a857efbc669246eb43904472627625dcdbbdb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Automatic update generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/nix-community/nixpkgs-update\">nixpkgs-update</a> tools. This update was made based on information from passthru.updateScript.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.description for polkit-stdin-agent is: Non-interactive polkit authentication agent that answers PAM prompts from a file descriptor</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">meta.homepage for polkit-stdin-agent is: <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/r-vdp/polkit-stdin-agent\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codeberg.org/r-vdp/polkit-stdin-agent</a></p>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Updates performed</h6>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Ran passthru.UpdateScript</li>\n</ul>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">To inspect upstream changes</h6>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Impact</h6>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><b>Checks done</b></p>\n<hr>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>built on NixOS</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-stop mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.47.22A.749.749 0 0 1 5 0h6c.199 0 .389.079.53.22l4.25 4.25c.141.14.22.331.22.53v6a.749.749 0 0 1-.22.53l-4.25 4.25A.749.749 0 0 1 11 16H5a.749.749 0 0 1-.53-.22L.22 11.53A.749.749 0 0 1 0 11V5c0-.199.079-.389.22-.53Zm.84 1.28L1.5 5.31v5.38l3.81 3.81h5.38l3.81-3.81V5.31L10.69 1.5ZM8 4a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 8 4Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Caution</p><p dir=\"auto\">A test defined in <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code> did not pass.</p>\n</div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>found 0.3.2 with grep in /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2</li>\n<li>found 0.3.2 in filename of file in /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<b>Rebuild report</b> (if merged into master) (click to expand)\n</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"5 total rebuild path(s)\n\n3 package rebuild(s)\n\nFirst fifty rebuilds by attrpath\n\npolkit-stdin-agent\nrun0-sudo-shim\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">5 total rebuild path(s)\n\n3 package rebuild(s)\n\nFirst fifty rebuilds by attrpath\n\npolkit-stdin-agent\nrun0-sudo-shim\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<b>Instructions to test this update</b> (click to expand)\n</summary>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Either <strong>download from the cache</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"nix-store -r /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2 \\\n  --option binary-caches 'https://cache.nixos.org/ https://nixpkgs-update-cache.nix-community.org/' \\\n  --option trusted-public-keys '\n  nixpkgs-update-cache.nix-community.org-1:U8d6wiQecHUPJFSqHN9GSSmNkmdiFW7GW7WNAnHW0SM=\n  cache.nixos.org-1:6NCHdD59X431o0gWypbMrAURkbJ16ZPMQFGspcDShjY=\n  '\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nix-store -r /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2 \\\n  --option binary-caches 'https://cache.nixos.org/ https://nixpkgs-update-cache.nix-community.org/' \\\n  --option trusted-public-keys '\n  nixpkgs-update-cache.nix-community.org-1:U8d6wiQecHUPJFSqHN9GSSmNkmdiFW7GW7WNAnHW0SM=\n  cache.nixos.org-1:6NCHdD59X431o0gWypbMrAURkbJ16ZPMQFGspcDShjY=\n  '\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">(The nixpkgs-update cache is only trusted for this store-path realization.)<br>\nFor the cached download to work, your user must be in the <code class=\"notranslate\">trusted-users</code> list or you can use <code class=\"notranslate\">sudo</code> since root is effectively trusted.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or, <strong>build yourself</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"nix-build -A polkit-stdin-agent https://github.com/r-ryantm/nixpkgs/archive/a146b872eb645de9886acef5079fc727bd114442.tar.gz\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nix-build -A polkit-stdin-agent https://github.com/r-ryantm/nixpkgs/archive/a146b872eb645de9886acef5079fc727bd114442.tar.gz\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"nix build github:r-ryantm/nixpkgs/a146b872eb645de9886acef5079fc727bd114442#polkit-stdin-agent\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nix build github:r-ryantm/nixpkgs/a146b872eb645de9886acef5079fc727bd114442#polkit-stdin-agent\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After you've downloaded or built it, look at the files and if there are any, run the binaries:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"ls -la /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2\nls -la /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2/bin\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ls -la /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2\nls -la /nix/store/pkl66wpi2m0dqszpmqdkgv57gbwy0049-polkit-stdin-agent-0.3.2/bin\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n</details>\n<br>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Pre-merge build results</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We have automatically built all packages that will get rebuilt due to<br>\nthis change.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This gives evidence on whether the upgrade will break dependent packages.<br>\nNote sometimes packages show up as <em>failed to build</em> independent of the<br>\nchange, simply because they are already broken on the target branch.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> result</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Generated using <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code></a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Command: <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review --extra-nixpkgs-config '{ allowBroken = false; }'</code><br>\nCommit: <code class=\"notranslate\">a146b872eb645de9886acef5079fc727bd114442</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">x86_64-linux</code></h3>\n<details>\n  <summary>✅ 2 packages built:</summary>\n  <ul dir=\"auto\">\n    <li>polkit-stdin-agent</li>\n    <li>run0-sudo-shim</li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Maintainer pings</h6>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/r-vdp/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/r-vdp\">@r-vdp</a> for <a href=\"https://github.com/nix-community/nixpkgs-update/blob/main/doc/nixpkgs-maintainer-faq.md#r-ryantm-opened-a-pr-for-my-package-what-do-i-do\">testing</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.